B.amX=new A.I(419,B.Xs)
B.a1p=s(["Creating items moved UP: a \u201c+\u201d now sits at the end of the top labels row \u2014 tap it to create a Note, Task, or Meeting. The dedicated buttons at the bottom are gone, so the bottom is just the Off/Commands/Dictate control and the list gets more room."],t.s)
B.aoe=new A.I(418,B.a1p)
B.Y4=s(["NEW: speakers. When a recording has more than one voice, its full-screen view shows the conversation broken out by speaker \u2014 \u201cSpeaker 1 / Speaker 2\u201d blocks with each person\u2019s words, and a play button on every block that plays exactly that stretch of audio.","Applies to NEW recordings made with the live (Deepgram) engine from this version on \u2014 older items don\u2019t have speaker data."],t.s)
